{
  "id": "gods-ben.10",
  "book": "gods-ben",
  "chapter": 10,
  "title": "God's Book of Ben — Chapter 10",
  "preamble": "",
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.1",
      "verse_number": 1,
      "en": "God said: Here is wisdom, O man: To be observant of all things and adapt thyself thereto on Jehovih's side.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.2",
      "verse_number": 2,
      "en": "To obtain great learning that applieth to the resurrection of thy soul in comprehending the works of the Almighty.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.3",
      "verse_number": 3,
      "en": "To suffer not thyself to be conceited in the wisdom of the moderns over the ancients, nor of the ancients over the moderns.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.4",
      "verse_number": 4,
      "en": "The Creator created man wisely for the time of the world in which man was created.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.5",
      "verse_number": 5,
      "en": "Thou art for this era, and not for the past.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.6",
      "verse_number": 6,
      "en": "The ancients were for the past era, and not for the present.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.7",
      "verse_number": 7,
      "en": "To know the present; to be up with the signs of the times, this it is, to see Jehovih's hand.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.8",
      "verse_number": 8,
      "en": "Make not a God of riches, nor of thy supposed sciences and learning.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.9",
      "verse_number": 9,
      "en": "For in the time thou seest men doing these things, behold, that is the time of a cyclic coil in the great beast.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.10",
      "verse_number": 10,
      "en": "Thy God and thy Savior shall surely be swept away.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.11",
      "verse_number": 11,
      "en": "Make Jehovih, the Creator, the idol of thy soul; neither setting up this or that as impossible.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.12",
      "verse_number": 12,
      "en": "Opening up thy understanding to find the tree of light and righteousness of soul.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.13",
      "verse_number": 13,
      "en": "Admitting that all things are possible in Jehovih's hands.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.14",
      "verse_number": 14,
      "en": "Then thy God shall surely not be swept away.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.15",
      "verse_number": 15,
      "en": "Look about thee, O man, and learn from the Sons and Daughters of Jehovih, the march of the Almighty's kingdoms.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.16",
      "verse_number": 16,
      "en": "Who shall make a system or a philosophy like Jehovih? What hast thou found that is infallible?",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.17",
      "verse_number": 17,
      "en": "The truth of yesterday is not a truth today; the truth of yesterday is the truth today.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.18",
      "verse_number": 18,
      "en": "Thou shalt come to understand even this.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.19",
      "verse_number": 19,
      "en": "To learn how to live; to rejoice, and to do good, and make thy neighbor rejoice also, this is wisdom.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gods-ben.10.20",
      "verse_number": 20,
      "en": "Let these be thy loves and the glory of thy speech, and thou shalt learn to prophesy concerning the ways of Jehovih.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}
